For example:
.Bd -literal
 [fips_sect]
 activate = 1
 install-version = 1
 conditional-errors = 1
 security-checks = 1
 module-mac = 41:D0:FA:C2:5D:41:75:CD:7D:C3:90:55:6F:A4:DC
 install-mac = FE:10:13:5A:D3:B4:C7:82:1B:1E:17:4C:AC:84:0C
 install-status = INSTALL_SELF_TEST_KATS_RUN
.Ed
.Sh NOTES
When using the FIPS provider, it is recommended that the
.Sy config_diagnostics
option is enabled to prevent accidental use of non-FIPS validated
algorithms via broken or mistaken configuration.
See
.Xr config 5 .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr config 5
.Xr openssl-fipsinstall 1
.Sh HISTORY
This functionality was added in OpenSSL 3.0.
